/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Airbnb Bangkok, the top tourism hub, from 2012 to 2022, shows a steady growth, a sharp COVID-19 downturn in 2020, and a rebound by 2022. Despite recovery, Airbnb listings show inconsistent performance. Prices often do not reflect demand, many listings sit empty despite high availability, and guest reviews are low for a large portion of properties. Multi-listing hosts also struggle with uneven results across their portfolios. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5 6 7]
